Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.68,0:01:17.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直憧憬着理莎能够成为我的女朋友 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.95,0:01:19.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起享受甜蜜的高中生活
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.27,0:01:22.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不了多久 我就会向你告白
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.51,0:01:25.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢你 请和我交往
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.10,0:01:27.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等待你的回复
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.09,0:01:37.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.33,0:01:43.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事 反正是人情巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.20,0:01:45.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 人情巧克力啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.94,0:02:04.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[亲！早就喜欢上你了]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.00,0:02:12.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都升高二了 你还是白痴一样地打哈欠嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.68,0:02:15.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要你管 没听说过冬眠不觉晓么 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.92,0:02:18.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么冬眠啊 应该是春眠不觉晓吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.80,0:02:20.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 好像是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.39,0:02:22.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是个白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.00,0:02:24.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴 你这大图腾
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.29,0:02:26.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是是 是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.17,0:02:30.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这水蚤也长大点了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.51,0:02:31.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.52,0:02:38.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁来救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.07,0:02:39.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稍微等下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.23,0:02:43.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来来 狗狗 不可以这样哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.09,0:02:47.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖 乖
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.54,0:02:48.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是陸奥五郎吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.54,0:02:48.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（陸奥五郎：日本动物学家。著有多本关于犬类的书籍。）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.43,0:02:53.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可是男生哦　一定要对女孩子温柔点哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.84,0:02:58.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全不懂如何和女孩子交往 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.95,0:03:00.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是应付男孩子倒是个天才嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.75,0:03:02.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 他是只公狗呀 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.50,0:03:05.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应付男孩子是个天才
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.09,0:03:11.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,ByeBye
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.24,0:03:15.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是谢谢你了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.50,0:03:17.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么名字
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.43,0:03:21.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姓名是什么无所谓啦 走啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.21,0:03:29.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢上他了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.98,0:03:37.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么都聚在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.70,0:03:40.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 是分班的告示
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.25,0:03:43.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎 我们还在一个班哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.13,0:03:45.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.68,0:03:48.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有我被分到隔壁班去了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.78,0:03:51.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是千春 你跟铃木同班耶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.94,0:03:52.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.81,0:03:57.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.07,0:03:59.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.21,0:04:02.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.70,0:04:03.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.15,0:04:03.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们同班…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.24,0:04:05.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.79,0:04:06.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好甜蜜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.73,0:04:10.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的 我们还是同班耶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.27,0:04:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗 真开心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.98,0:04:14.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小信
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.31,0:04:16.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.02,0:04:24.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然还跟小泉同班
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.88,0:04:27.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要到何时才能摆脱[ALL阪神·巨人]的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.38,0:04:31.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你再长高点再说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.46,0:04:32.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴 你才该变矮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.16,0:04:34.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少说这种不可能的事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.30,0:04:38.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说还是老样子 今年好像有点不同
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.63,0:04:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,导师还是那老头 一定是他干的好事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.99,0:04:44.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原本是我天敌的大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.35,0:04:48.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在在我心中竟占有微妙的一席之地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.99,0:04:52.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞不好 我对大谷…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.20,0:04:58.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不 不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.32,0:04:59.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.08,0:05:00.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.21,0:05:03.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,隔壁班有个名字好眼熟哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.84,0:05:07.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿遥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.33,0:05:09.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不了多久 我就会向你告白
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.29,0:05:12.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢你 请和我交往
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.73,0:05:14.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.85,0:05:20.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真遗憾啊 我走啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.63,0:05:21.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个叛徒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.48,0:05:26.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情人节收到的是人情巧克力也就罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.73,0:05:28.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本以为该忍的都忍了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.12,0:05:31.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁知居然不能跟理莎同班
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.39,0:05:34.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 差点忘了你有说过四月会转来的了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.38,0:05:36.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差点忘了？ 原来是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.42,0:05:40.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道 难道理莎已经忘了我了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.55,0:05:43.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没这回事 我怎么敢忘了你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.12,0:05:46.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骗人 你一定忘了 你真过分
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.81,0:05:48.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的没有啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.55,0:05:50.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.66,0:05:52.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走啦 开学典礼要开始喽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.04,0:05:53.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.49,0:05:56.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿遥 就这样 过会儿见
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.94,0:06:00.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.88,0:06:03.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这叛徒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.55,0:06:04.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放手 巨人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.72,0:06:06.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是不想打扰你们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.82,0:06:08.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁要你多管闲事了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.78,0:06:10.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是老样子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.39,0:06:12.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真精彩的相声
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.51,0:06:13.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.64,0:06:14.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还真是有默契
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.87,0:06:22.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我又要和大谷同班一年了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.68,0:06:30.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是同一个人 就是这个学长
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.81,0:06:39.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我们得选出担任杂七杂八职务的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.78,0:06:42.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但为了省事 我们先选出班级干部就好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.06,0:06:44.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他的都交给班级干部决定
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.88,0:06:46.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.88,0:06:47.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 那就请…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.58,0:06:51.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不要看那个老头 小泉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.11,0:06:52.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.79,0:06:57.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 那就请正很有默契地用眼神在交流的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.27,0:06:58.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉和大谷担任吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.36,0:07:00.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.62,0:07:02.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赞成的人举手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.82,0:07:04.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赞成
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.30,0:07:05.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.80,0:07:06.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.98,0:07:07.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这么决定 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.68,0:07:09.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜两位 支持率100%
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.97,0:07:12.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新官上任 虽然紧了点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.28,0:07:14.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,待会要举行一年级的入学典礼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.55,0:07:16.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们快去帮忙准备吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.69,0:07:17.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.14,0:07:19.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真厉害 他们好有默契啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.19,0:07:24.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们两个就是1年2班被称为[ALL阪神·巨人]的人嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.26,0:07:29.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 随他们去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.30,0:07:32.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么 你又要当叛徒吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.42,0:07:36.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就想成继去年之后连任吧 就照做喽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.53,0:07:49.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走啦 大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.76,0:07:51.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.55,0:07:57.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.80,0:07:59.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,社团活动
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.49,0:08:01.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你吹牛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.92,0:08:05.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在正在举行入学典礼 哪里有社团活动
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.47,0:08:08.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是 是练习公演
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.65,0:08:11.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该去帮忙入学典礼 想跷掉么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.86,0:08:13.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在没空去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.93,0:08:14.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.08,0:08:17.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从今年起我就成为篮球社正式队员 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.82,0:08:19.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要上场比赛了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.23,0:08:20.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.41,0:08:25.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的 春假中决定的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.48,0:08:28.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很厉害喔 2年级只有他一个呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:30.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁要你多嘴的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.17,0:08:33.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下任队长超级候选人No.1
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.26,0:08:35.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要多嘴啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.51,0:08:52.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说起来 大谷真的很努力呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.13,0:08:54.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明开心得不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.86,0:08:59.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我也没办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.72,0:09:01.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是两码事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.20,0:09:14.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不爽 真不爽 你这女人真是烦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.05,0:09:15.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少罗嗦 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.59,0:09:19.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不是你 答应接下班级干部的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.28,0:09:23.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身为男人在那种情况下能不答应嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.77,0:09:27.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为了耍酷把我拖下水
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.57,0:09:28.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可知道给我添了多大麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.15,0:09:30.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很吵哎 巨大图腾
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.84,0:09:31.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴 水蚤
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.63,0:09:35.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 大家辛苦了 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.11,0:09:38.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎 结束了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.66,0:09:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.27,0:09:43.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 你在等我呀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.22,0:09:44.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.10,0:09:48.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看你看 一年级的已经陆续进场了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.53,0:09:51.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都穿着挺刮的制服
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.61,0:09:52.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好新的感觉哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.07,0:09:58.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了小信 入学典礼时你穿的衣服超可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.53,0:09:59.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把老师气得半死呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.98,0:10:03.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为那时还没拿到制服啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.89,0:10:05.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没拿到制服？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.18,0:10:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算入学典礼不穿制服，也要穿件整齐点的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.08,0:10:14.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然有但…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.84,0:10:17.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为人家昨天买了件超可爱的T恤
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.11,0:10:21.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要赶快穿上它出门嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.11,0:10:23.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.12,0:10:27.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为说对不起就可以了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.58,0:10:28.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 很可爱对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.11,0:10:30.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算可爱 也不可以今天穿来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.21,0:10:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该着装整齐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.07,0:10:36.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎 好可怜 一开学就被盯上 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.69,0:10:38.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.75,0:10:39.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.18,0:10:43.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那美眉挺搞怪的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.02,0:10:44.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.61,0:10:48.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 这样我的面子何在
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.81,0:10:49.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.50,0:10:53.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说 等我像老师这么老的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.15,0:10:55.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就不能穿这么可爱的衣服啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.19,0:10:59.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以不趁年轻赶快穿的话 就要变欧巴桑了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.06,0:11:03.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说谁是欧巴桑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.85,0:11:06.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 没什么 我不是在说老师哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.65,0:11:08.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了好了 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.74,0:11:13.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老师 不好了 那边有男生在打架
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.66,0:11:15.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.06,0:11:20.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骗你的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.41,0:11:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,学姐是今天早上的…？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.54,0:11:25.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 是你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.12,0:11:30.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们认识吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.00,0:11:32.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.07,0:11:34.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个 刚刚你说骗人的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.28,0:11:39.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 那老师很固执的 你最好小心一点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.60,0:11:41.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,惨的话 可以对你说教说上一个小时呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.17,0:11:45.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.22,0:11:47.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.97,0:11:50.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪里哪里 别客气
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.75,0:11:55.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.72,0:12:00.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 小泉 我要走了 可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.94,0:12:03.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.89,0:12:31.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要我陪你去买衣服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.56,0:12:35.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,决不能输给新生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.66,0:12:40.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么关系啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.91,0:12:42.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用不着为了这点小事产生敌意吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.19,0:12:43.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有关系
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.35,0:12:47.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 可是 你还真有钱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.97,0:12:50.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我每天晚上都帮妈妈按摩肩膀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.64,0:13:01.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个护腕 应该很适合大谷哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.23,0:13:05.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是白痴啊 那又怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.95,0:13:07.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从今年起我就成为篮球社正式队员 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.15,0:13:09.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要上场比赛了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.77,0:13:15.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.67,0:13:18.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,店员正盯着你看呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.19,0:13:20.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要买这个
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.96,0:13:26.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.99,0:13:30.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真没礼貌 这是我送给你的礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.08,0:13:33.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么礼物 会带来不幸的礼物吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.67,0:13:35.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,陷阱 一定是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.92,0:13:37.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.02,0:13:40.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要我上次在二手CD店买的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.26,0:13:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,附有海坊主签名的CD 对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.82,0:13:45.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我决不会给你的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.28,0:13:46.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.90,0:13:49.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本想庆祝你成为篮球队正式队员的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.79,0:13:51.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要就还我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.67,0:13:52.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦 真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.78,0:13:54.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骗你的 我戴一定很好看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.08,0:13:57.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 真好看 很帅
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.15,0:13:59.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.54,0:14:02.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帅吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.94,0:14:06.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还可以
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.92,0:14:09.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢啦 我收下喽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.55,0:14:12.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到你也会这么好心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.64,0:14:14.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是心血来潮而已
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.06,0:14:22.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎 你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.50,0:14:24.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是在想 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.16,0:14:28.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先不说身高 我的性格本身也有问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.23,0:14:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.21,0:14:33.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好希望自己能变得可爱一点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.73,0:14:34.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变可爱？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.99,0:14:35.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.21,0:14:39.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了 突然说出这种好像恋爱中少女说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.10,0:14:41.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诶 有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.95,0:14:42.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.13,0:14:45.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真伤脑筋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.95,0:14:46.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,学姐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.66,0:14:50.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,学姐好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.94,0:14:52.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,入学典礼时的事 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.75,0:14:54.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.51,0:14:59.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不妙 可能有血光之灾
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.07,0:15:03.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 学姐你的手镯好可爱 哪里买的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.11,0:15:06.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊？这个啊 这件是在…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.56,0:15:07.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们够了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.84,0:15:09.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这孩子真乖
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.52,0:15:12.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.00,0:15:14.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 有什么事情吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.09,0:15:18.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,学姐你们有参加社团活动吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.84,0:15:19.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.17,0:15:21.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有想参加的社团吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.48,0:15:25.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为明天体育馆会有社团介绍
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.61,0:15:27.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想看了再决定
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.89,0:15:31.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的说他要演黑衣人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.13,0:15:34.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑衣人？篮球社到底要介绍什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.31,0:15:37.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道 听说大谷也会上去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.37,0:15:40.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听起来好像很有趣耶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.89,0:15:44.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我会认真看篮球社的介绍的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.26,0:15:46.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.46,0:15:51.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世界上有这么可爱的女生
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.75,0:15:54.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我却偏偏生成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.26,0:15:57.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神哪 你太偏心了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.31,0:16:11.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跷课去看 没关系吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.86,0:16:13.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系 反正是自习嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.59,0:16:18.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且只有介绍社团的人可以不用上课 真过分
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.98,0:16:21.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很想看亲爱的演的黑衣人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.18,0:16:23.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑衣人到底是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.50,0:16:25.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.53,0:16:24.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,游泳部介绍完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.56,0:16:28.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来是男子篮球社
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.78,0:16:32.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目前本篮球社共有11名成员
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.16,0:16:36.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,常常打进地区决赛 是非常优秀的社团
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.73,0:16:39.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然 初学者我们也非常欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.83,0:16:42.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打不好的人加入后一定也可以打得好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.15,0:16:46.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,中尾和大谷在哪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.00,0:16:49.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好奇怪哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.75,0:16:52.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各位同学 请看后面
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.05,0:16:58.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边的小个子同学
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.76,0:17:05.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.32,0:17:10.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加入本社后 竟变得会飞身灌篮了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.72,0:17:17.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.42,0:17:32.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,orz
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.28,0:17:34.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 热烈鼓掌
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.07,0:17:36.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.33,0:17:38.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,球呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.69,0:17:42.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是败给他们了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.32,0:17:45.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪 我不想看到我男朋友这么逊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.24,0:17:49.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看 连这种矮冬瓜都可以灌篮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.62,0:17:51.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈一定会很高兴的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.31,0:17:53.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说谁是矮冬瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.11,0:17:59.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男子篮球社期待大家的加入
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.15,0:18:01.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身高不是问题
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.80,0:18:03.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,矮个子同学也可以加入哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.79,0:18:14.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了好了 住手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.04,0:18:22.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.97,0:18:33.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们刚刚在耍什么宝啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.25,0:18:35.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也来看了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.48,0:18:42.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看 小信到现在还没从打击中恢复过来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.42,0:18:43.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得还挺好玩的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.64,0:18:44.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点也不好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.76,0:18:45.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁理她啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.74,0:18:48.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们为了征集社员都很拼命
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.47,0:18:50.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为指导老师太凶 走了很多人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.88,0:18:52.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以最好一开始多招点人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.28,0:18:56.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用那么逊的方式 招得到人嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.40,0:18:57.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.87,0:18:59.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点也不逊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.32,0:19:10.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 是上次那个学妹
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.32,0:19:11.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.37,0:19:16.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开学典礼那天 你帮忙赶狗的那个
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.72,0:19:20.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不记得我了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.32,0:19:25.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用在意 这家伙是个白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.72,0:19:26.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你讨打啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.99,0:19:28.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系的 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.66,0:19:34.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,学长刚刚飞身灌篮 好帅喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.47,0:19:37.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听到没 人家刚刚说的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.47,0:19:39.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.48,0:19:53.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是2年3班的大谷敦士
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.48,0:19:54.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.28,0:19:59.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是1年4班的寿寿圣子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.92,0:20:01.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,圣子呀 好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.96,0:20:07.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.40,0:20:39.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早就喜欢上你了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.69,0:20:44.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呃！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.80,0:20:53.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.31,0:20:57.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的身体反应总是比脑子慢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.66,0:20:59.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 是比脑子快
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.35,0:21:01.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你讨厌我了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.13,0:21:04.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 那倒不会 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.15,0:21:13.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这么做好像有点先斩后奏
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.16,0:21:18.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以的话 我们可以先从朋友开始交往吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.95,0:21:32.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.23,0:21:37.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 我好高兴哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.90,0:21:43.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么状况啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.06,0:23:27.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真是个邪恶的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.89,0:23:30.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然一瞬间让圣子坠入爱河
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.75,0:23:33.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 你给我适可而止
